{"id": "section-body-18254", "title": "Odontogenic and Non- Odontogenic Cysts", "chapterId": "chapter-sixteen", "blocks": [{"id": "body-18254", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Odontogenic and Non- Odontogenic Cysts", "runs": [{"text": "Odontogenic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Non-"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Odontogenic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Cysts"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1126"}}, {"id": "body-18256", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Odontogenic cysts", "runs": [{"text": "Odontogenic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cysts"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18257", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "A group of jaw cysts that are formed from tissues involved in odontogenesis (tooth development).", "runs": [{"text": "A"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "group"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "jaw"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cysts"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "that"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "formed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "from"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tissues"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "involved"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "odontogenesis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(tooth"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "development)."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1087"}}, {"id": "body-18258", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Odontogenic cysts are closed sacs filled with fluid, and have a distinct membrane derived from rests of odontogenic epithelium.", "runs": [{"text": "Odontogenic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cysts"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "closed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sacs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "filled"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fluid,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "have"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "distinct"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "membrane"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "derived"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "from"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rests of odontogenic epithelium."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1087"}}, {"id": "body-18260", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-odontogenic jaw cysts", "runs": [{"text": "Non-odontogenic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "jaw"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cysts"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18261", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "A group of cysts arising from epithelial remnants of embryonic ducts left behind after embryonal facial and jaw development; they are located deep within the tissues in the region of former epithelial ridges, epithelial walls, and primary facial fissural and cleft structures.", "runs": [{"text": "A group of cysts arising from epithelial remnants of embryonic ducts left behind after embryonal facial and jaw development; they are located deep within the tissues in the region of former epithelial ridges, epithelial walls, and primary facial fissural and cleft structures."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1087"}}, {"id": "body-18262", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Some few examples of frequently encountered cysts in the orofacial region are:", "runs": [{"text": "Some"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "few"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "examples"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "frequently"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "encountered"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cysts"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "orofacial"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "region"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are:"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1087"}}, {"id": "body-18264", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Dentigerous cyst", "runs": [{"text": "Dentigerous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cyst"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1126"}}, {"id": "body-18265", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyT