, "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Translucent, blue, dome-shaped, fluctuant swelling in the tissues of the floor of the mouth.", "runs": [{"text": "Translucent,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "blue,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dome-shaped,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fluctuant"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "swelling"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tissues"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "floor"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mouth."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1083"}}, {"id": "body-18310", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "The swelling is not fixed, may not show blanching, and is non-painful unless it becomes secondarily infected.", "runs": [{"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "swelling"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fixed,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "show"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "blanching,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "non-painful"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "unless"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "it"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "becomes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "secondarily"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "infected."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1083"}}, {"id": "body-18311", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "The usual location is lateral to the midline, which may be used to help distinguish it from a midline dermoid cyst.", "runs": [{"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "usual"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "location"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lateral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "midline,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "which"}, {"text": " "